<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds close buoyed, await rate decision - Jan 23.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds close buoyed, await rate decision - Jan 23.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bonds ended well-supported along the yield curve amid expectations of possible rate cuts tomorrow.</p>
<p>*March 97 futures up 0.23 points to 108.48</p>
<p>*Feb 06 cash 119.60 (119.59), yld 6.56 vs 6.56 cls</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -10 bps vs -4 bps cls</p>
